  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.QdrantOASIS v2.0.2\n\nQdrant OASIS Provider — high-performance vector database for semantic search over OASIS holons and avatars via Qdrant REST API. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- Automate coordinated OASIS platform releases (7ed2053)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- feat(providers): add 11 analytical and RESP-compatible storage providers (161 total) (d2eedce)\n- Fix provider CI and patch database dependencies (fb68db4)\n- Fix remaining integration and coverage failures (d8a5553)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.QdrantOASIS",
